  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDC Long term Development Impact study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Longitudinal Mobilisation Study is the first in a series of sectoral evaluations being undertaken across British International Investment&apos;s (BII) portfolio to assess BII&#x2019;s overall performance and effectiveness. The purpose of the Study is to examine BII&#x2019;s impact on wider private sector investment activity and to provide evidence on whether and how the investment activity of BII is mobilising private sector investment in different contexts.</narrative>
  </description>
